"unverified, self-signed certificates. For example, outgoing webhooks to a"
" server with a self-signed TLS certificate, using any domain, will be "
"allowed, and will skip TLS verification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:340
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Only secure HTTPS requests are allowed."
msgstr ""

