msgid "Replica lag settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1089
msgid ""
"String array input specifies a connection string and user-defined SQL "
"queries on the database to measure replica lag for a single replica "
"instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:1093
msgid ""
"These settings monitor absolute lag based on binlog distance/transaction "
"queue length, and the time taken for the replica to catch up."
msgstr ""

