msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3821
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, user sessions are cleared when a user tries"
" to log in, and sessions are cleared every 24 hours from the sessions "
"database table. Configure session lengths by going to **System Console > "
"Environment > Session Lengths**, or by editing the ``config.json`` file "
"as described in the following tables. Changes to configuration settings "
"in this section require a server restart before taking effect."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3833
msgid "Extend session length with activity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3836
msgid ""
"Improves the user experience by extending sessions and keeping users "
"logged in if they are active in their Mattermost apps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3839
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Sessions are automatically extended when users "
"are active in their Mattermost client. User sessions only expire when "
"users aren’t active in their Mattermost client for the entire duration of"
" the session lengths defined."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3844
msgid ""
"**false**: Sessions won't extend with activity in Mattermost. User "
"sessions immediately expire at the end of the session length or based on "
"the `session idle timeout <#session-idle-timeout>`__ configured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3836
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3863
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3892
