msgid "Enable or disable session revocation when a user's password changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3866
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default for new deployments)** Session revocation is "
"enabled. All sessions of a user expire if their password is changed (by "
"themselves or by a system admin). If the password change is initiated by "
"the user, their current session isn't terminated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3872
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default for existing deployments)** Session revocation is "
"disabled. When users change their password, only the user's current "
"session is revoked. When a system admin changes the user's password, none"
" of the user's sessions are revoked."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3864
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``TerminateSessionsOnPasswordChange`` > ``true``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:3865
