#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4090
msgid ""
"The total number of user IDs is limited to 5 to ensure performance. "
"Adding more IDs can overwhelm Prometheus due to high label cardinality. "
"To avoid performance issues, we recommend minimizing changes to this "
"list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4100
msgid "Listen address"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4103
msgid ""
"The port the Mattermost server will listen on to expose performance "
"metrics, when enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4106
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **8067**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4104
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``MetricsSettings`` > ``ListenAddress`` > "
"``8067``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4105
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_METRICSSETTINGS_LISTENADDRESS``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4111
msgid ""
"``ListenAddress`` accepts a port only. It doesn’t take an IP/host. If you"
" need to restrict interfaces, do so via your OS firewall or reverse "
"proxy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4112
msgid ""
"The address uses a ``host:port`` format. Use ``:8067`` to listen on all "
"interfaces on port **8067**, or use ``localhost:8067`` to restrict to "
"**localhost** only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4122
msgid "Block profile rate"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4125
msgid ""
"Control how often Mattermost collects data about delays caused by "
"blocking operations within Mattermost (such as when one part of the "
"program has to wait for another). Default is **0** (profiling is "
"disabled)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4130
msgid ""
"The profiler aims to sample an average of one blocking event per rate "
"nanoseconds spent blocked."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4133
msgid "Default is **0**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4125
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4477
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4628
