#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4171
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`performance monitoring <administration-guide/scale/deploy-"
"prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring:getting started>` "
"documentation to learn more about Mattermost Notification Health metrics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4177
msgid "Developer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4179
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, you can configure developer mode by going "
"to **System Console > Environment > Developer**, or by editing the "
"``config.json`` file as described in the following tables. Changes to "
"configuration settings in this section require a server restart before "
"taking effect."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4192
msgid "Enable testing commands"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4195
msgid "Enable or disable the ``/test`` slash command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4197
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** The ``/test`` slash command is enabled to load "
"test accounts and test data. Use this setting only in isolated non-"
"production environments and never in production."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4202
