#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4483
msgid ""
"**false**: Server-side requests made to the Mattermost Customer Portal "
"are enabled, but will always fail in air-gapped and restricted deployment"
" environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4478
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``CloudSettings`` > ``Disable`` > ``true,``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4479
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_CLOUDSETTINGS_DISABLE``"
