msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4561
msgid "Allow permanent channel deletion via API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings.rst:4563
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**true**: System admins (or users with appropriate permissions) can call "
"``api/v4/channels/{channelid}?permanent=true`` or use ``mmctl channel "
